<b>B R O W S E R S

<c>[1·Browser1]
<c>[2·Browser2]

There are 2 Browsers. Each Browser is used to browse the Music library.
Use focus-keys 1 or 2 to select a Browser. Otherwise, click on their tab-labels.

When a Browser is selected, Left-section will show its View, while Right-section
will show its Tabs.

Browser's Tabs:
->  2 Tabs containing a total of 6 tag-fields.
->  1 Tab with the Properties of the selected Audiofile.
->  1 Tab with a treeview of the working directory
->  ...

There are 6 tag-fields:
Genres, Artists, Albums, AlbumArtists, Composers, Years.
Each Browser's fields-tab contains 3 Fields.
Inside the Field-window, it is possible to activate 1 or more values. The 
Browser's View will be filled with the audiofiles filtered by the activated 
values.

In Dirs it is possible to set the working directory for each Browser.
This must be the Music Library's directory or one of its subdirectories.
The Browser will show only the audiofiles contained under that directory.
The second segment of the Display shows details about the selected Browser.